# Job budgets in minutes, one raise per line with its reason; a raise without a reason is refused.
# The default is 20 minutes. A repository may raise a budget further, with a reason, in its own copy.
falsify 30 Kani install plus the replay of every falsification patch
drift 30 two channels, stable and beta, each building, testing and linting
msrv 30 installs the manifest's rust-version and builds and tests at it
semver 30 cargo-semver-checks builds the crate against its previous release tag
miri 60 Miri is an order of magnitude slower than the tests it runs
mutation 60 one shard of cargo-mutants, which builds one test binary per mutant, two at a time
fuzz 30 five minutes per fuzz target plus the nightly toolchain
publish 30 cargo publish --dry-run, then the crates.io publish itself
